<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Compute Resources</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All experiments were conducted on two NVIDIA A100 GPUs (80GB memory each).
Training runs for the full Qwen-2.5-7B experiments required approximately
20 hours wall clock time.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
