trained for 10 epochs with a learning rate of <math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{e-}3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>e-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{e-}3</annotation></semantics></math>. Only LoRA parameters were updated.</p>
</div></li>
