<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Performance under bits based gating at 0.08 and 0.06 bits/token thresholds.
Baseline: base model with no continual learning.
Final: adapted model after 8 sequential updates.
KL divergence shows per step drift between consecutive models (starting at step 2).
Total KL represents the drift from base to final model.</figcaption>
</figure>
